The same zone can be printed as geometry instead of wiring. This cropped geometry view shows the hidden physical model: terminal bands, fan-in/fan-out bands, longitude tracks, latitude tracks, extra routing shells, transition regions, and chip frames all have names and spans before a single wire is drawn.

